# Block root body spacing

After the document-root opening tag (`<block …>` or a type tag), leave **one blank line** before the first child (`<name>`, `<type>`, `<baseType>`, …).

```xml
<!-- ❌ BAD -->
<playground:MyLatestStory
  xmlns="http://blockml.org/bml"
  …>
  <name>MyLatestStory</name>

<!-- ✅ GOOD -->
<playground:MyLatestStory
  xmlns="http://blockml.org/bml"
  …>

  <name>MyLatestStory</name>
```

Legacy `<block>` uses the same blank line after the xmlns header. Do not insert extra blank lines.
